                <pb facs="0287" n="171" xml:id="pg171"/>

                <head>Treaty for the advancement of general peace, concluded between the United
                    States and Costa Rica</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, February 13, 1914; ratification
                        advised by the Senate, August 13, 1914; ratified by the President, November
                        11, 1914; ratified by Costa Rica, July 25, 1914; ratifications exchanged at
                        Washington, November 12, 1914; proclaimed, November 13, 1914</hi>.</p>

